                  "content": "I build LLM applications end to end: RAG retrieval, agent and multi-agent orchestration with LangChain and LangGraph, MCP servers, and local-LLM applications that run models directly on the handset instead of relying on a server. I’m comfortable under the hood — tokenization, vector embeddings, attention, and transformer mathematics — not just at the SDK layer. That depth is often what separates a demo from something that holds up when faced with real questions.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.65,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xxPcg",
                  "fill": "$ink-500",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The other half is shipping. Three apps are live across the App Store and Google Play, a wearable is in progress that captures audio and answers questions about it entirely on-device, and a node-based calculation canvas has a formula engine written from scratch. Underneath it all is a long stretch of MERN and Fastify backend work.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.65,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Ugs17",
                  "name": "abb",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "alignItems": "center",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "Ue2DQ",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "eLOQi",
                      "descendants": {
                        "lpQH8": {
                          "content": "GET IN TOUCH"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "D8ePy",
                      "type": "ref",
                      "ref": "lN6lI"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
